{'symbol': 'JNPR', 'date': '2023-04-26 11:00:00', 'title': 'JUNIPER NETWORKS RECOGNIZES BLACK BOX AS A 2022 PARTNER OF THE YEAR', 'text': 'MUMBAI, INDIA--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #ITINFRASTRUCTURE--BLACK BOX®, A TRUSTED IT SOLUTIONS PROVIDER, HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED AS A 2022 PARTNER OF THE YEAR BY JUNIPER NETWORKS, A LEADER IN SECURE, AI-DRIVEN NETWORKS. EACH YEAR, JUNIPER NETWORKS RECOGNIZES PARTNERS FOR THEIR ABILITY TO DRIVE INNOVATIVE BUSINESS SOLUTIONS, FOR THEIR UNDIVIDED ATTENTION TO THE CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE, AND ACHIEVEMENT OF THEIR FINANCIAL GOALS. BLACK BOX WAS HONORED IN THE ALLIANCES CATEGORY FOR ITS ABILITY TO DEVELOP INNOVATIVE DATA CENTER AND CLO.'}